<h2>Light and Dark Mode</h2><br/>
As with other Apple devices, the HomeView will have Light Mode and <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/ios-dark-mode/">Dark Mode</a> options, with the device able to swap between modes automatically based on time of day.<br/>
<br/>
<h2>Snoopy</h2><br/>
The HomeView has a bunch of different Snoopy animations if you pick the Snoopy face. <br/>
<br/>
